            "question": "What is the difference between a MARCEL OSMF Consultant and an OSMF Specialist Doctor?",
            "answer": "<p>A MARCEL OSMF Consultant provides an on-call consultation, allowing you to discuss your concerns and understand the next step remotely. An OSMF Specialist Doctor provides an in-clinic, in-person consultation, where the doctor can examine your mouth, assess mouth opening and evaluate oral tissue changes directly.</p>"
