          "settings": {
            "question": "Which consultation should I choose?",
            "answer": "<p>If you want to discuss your symptoms and understand how to proceed, start with the MARCEL OSMF Consultant on-call service. If you need a direct examination, have significant difficulty opening your mouth, or notice a persistent ulcer, unexplained lump, bleeding or another concerning change, arrange an in-clinic consultation with an OSMF Specialist Doctor.</p>"
