            "question": "Can I use MARCEL OMR Therapy™ while receiving treatment from another doctor?",
            "answer": "<p>Tell the MARCEL OSMF Consultant or your treating doctor about the medicines, procedures and oral products you are currently using. Do not stop or change prescribed treatment on your own. They can help you decide whether the approaches can be used together and whether an in-person assessment is needed.</p>"
          }
        },
