            "question": "Do I need surgery if my mouth opening is very limited?",
            "answer": "<p>Not everyone with OSMF needs surgery. The decision depends on the degree of restriction and the clinical findings. An OSMF Specialist Doctor can examine you and discuss appropriate options, including whether non-surgical care, a procedure or a combination should be considered.</p>"
